# Avoid sending node_modules, virtualenvs, build artifacts, and the git tree
# to the docker build context. Without this, `docker build` would copy the
# entire repo + its node_modules into the image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/target
.git
.github
.claude
desktop
tests
docs
*.log
